# [MODULE DOC]
# Meson-configured include file (becomes _blas_int.pxi, included by
# _cython_blas.pyx). The placeholder is replaced at build time by a ctypedef
# or cimport defining blas_int: SciPy's blas_int when scipy.linalg.cython_blas
# provides it (e.g. ILP64 builds), otherwise plain int. The BLAS wrappers
# convert their int size and stride arguments to blas_int before calling SciPy.
# This will be a plain `int` if scipy.linalg.cython_blas doesn't have `blas_int`, and
# `blas_int` if it does. See `meson.build` in this directory for the compile-time check.
@BLAS_INT_DEF@
